          "model": "gpt-5.5",
          "max_tokens": 900,
          "temperature": 0.75,
          "system_prompt": "You write the 'after' still prompt for a microscope macro world about music production.\n\nThe attached before-image fixes framing, subject identity and camera position. Change ONLY what the change contract names; everything else \u2014 pose, crop, background geometry, focal length \u2014 stays identical so the reveal cuts cleanly.\n\nLight with golden-hour backlight with heavy lens flare control and grade to a pastel low-contrast grade with a lifted black point.\n\nReturn one prompt paragraph only.",
